# Vizion Trak — publish the website only.
# Root-level files (.belt, *.md, *.html, crawl_results, screenshots, etc.)
# are local design/planning tooling and should NOT be committed.

# 1) Ignore all root-level content by default
/*

# 2) Re-include the website folder (and only it)
!/demo/
!/demo/**

# 3) Keep this file + the GitHub Actions workflows tracked
!.gitignore
!/.github/
!/.github/**

# 4) Editor / OS noise (defensive)
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db